   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi everyone, <br><br>I just tried to do my first formative construct with lavaan using the following code: <br><br>myMLmodel &lt;- &#39;level: 1<br>          fw =~ a*V2 + b*V3 + d*V4 + e*V5 <br>          level: 2<br>          fb =~ f*V2 + g*V3 + h*V4 + i*V5 &#39;<br>fit &lt;- sem(myMLmodel, myData, cluster = &quot;V1&quot;, estimator = &quot;MLR&quot;)<br>summary(fit, fit.measures = TRUE, standardized = TRUE)<br><br>Model estimation terminated normally and the results (N par, estimates as well as model fit indices such as BIC and AIC) are identically to Mplus output - accept that: <br><br>a) no CFI and TLI are reported <br>b) SRMR are weird: 1.457 (compared to the Mplus one: .024 within /.009 between)<br>c) RSMEA is slightly higher than in Mplus (.086 vs. .064). <br><br>Additionally, I get the following warning, which might be de reason for the issues above: <br><br><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important;line-height:12.499999046325684px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:-webkit-left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Warning message:\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">In pchisq(XX2, df = df2, ncp = ncp) :</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"> NaNs wurden erzeugt</span></pre><br>What do I miss here? Many thanks for your support!<br><br>Best, Christoph<span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"></span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"></span><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important;line-height:12.499999046325684px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:-webkit-left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br></pre></div>"
