    [
     1,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div><div>Two problems:</div><div><br></div><div>1) You have specified a factor model, not a formative model. See <a href=\"https://stats.stackexchange.com/questions/154588/how-to-use-formative-indicators-in-covariance-based-sem-with-lavaan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://stats.stackexchange.com/questions/154588/how-to-use-formative-indicators-in-covariance-based-sem-with-lavaan&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792427166738000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1WA77C07PLOctr-2APtR8j\">https://stats.stackexchange.com/questions/154588/how-to-use-formative-indicators-in-covariance-based-sem-with-lavaan</a></div><div><br></div><div>2) As far as I know, lavaan does not yet support multilevel SEM. Please correct me if this is outdated information.</div><div><br></div><div>Mikko</div><div><br><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div></div></blockquote></div></div></div>"
    ],
