     1,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div><div><div>The documentation of the current development version (<span style=\"font-family:sans-serif;font-size:13.333333015441895px;text-align:center\">0.6-1.1131) says that the cluster argument is not currently used:</span></div><div><br></div><table summary=\"R argblock\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:sans-serif;font-size:13.333333015441895px\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td style=\"font-size:10pt;min-width:24px;padding-right:12px\"><code>cluster</code></td><td style=\"font-size:10pt\"><p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:6px\">Not used yet.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><div><br></div><div>and the model syntax description does not explain the specification of the levels. I assume that these features are still in development.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>How did you know how to specify levels in the model syntax?</div><div><br></div><div>Mikko</div></div></div></div>"
    ],
